   "announcedAt": "2024-05-15T18:28:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're excited to announce an UPDATE for Unleaving, based on your requests and valuable feedback! Here's what's new:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Localization in more languages: Now you can enjoy the game in Portuguese-Brazilian, Russian, Italian, and Turkish.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Experience smoother gameplay: We've increased jumping/push responsiveness, specifically tailored for PCs with minimal requirements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Hinting System: We've made minor adjustments to our hinting system to provide even better guidance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimized Music Volume: Enjoy a seamless audio experience as we've normalized the music volume.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Side note: We wanted to remind players that on instance of dying during Unleaving’s gameplay they can press any key to immediately trigger level restart instead of waiting 3 seconds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy gaming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
